    },
    "Some audio couldn't be captured" : {

    },
    "Standard buffers capture generously so audio never breaks up, at about 20 ms of delay — right for music, video and games. Ultra-Low cuts that for live monitoring, but leaves the system less room to keep up and can click on busy machines or wide audio interfaces." : {

    },
    "Start Mixing" : {

    },
    "Starts MixPill automatically at login" : {

    },
    "That preset no longer exists. Save it again in MixPill." : {

    },
    "To give an app its own volume, MixPill receives that app's sound before it reaches your speakers, applies your settings, and plays it back. It asks for no permissions to do this — no screen recording, no microphone. Nothing is written to disk and nothing leaves your Mac." : {

    },
    "Turn MixPill on under Privacy & Security › Accessibility. This updates itself." : {
