    "Welcome to MixPill" : {

    },
    "What MixPill does with your audio" : {

    },
    "When a VoIP app (Zoom, Teams, Discord, Webex, Slack) is actively producing audio, all other apps are smoothly reduced to 20% volume and restored when the call audio stops. Ducking runs inside the MixPillCore service, so it keeps working even when the popover is closed." : {

